meta {
  name: Scan (full import)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/scan
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Runs a full import synchronously and returns the resulting `ImportReport`
  (`{ perAdapter, durationMs }`) with `200` when every adapter finished cleanly.

  The scan shares `scout serve`'s privacy mode: start the server with
  `--no-titles` to keep harness-generated session titles out of the database.

  An `ImportReport` with any adapter `error` or any `failed > 0` is a failed
  scan; the response is `500` with
  `{ "error": "one or more imports failed", "report": { ... } }`.
}
